{"seq":1,"slug":"gtin-upc-ean-isbn-structure","title":"GTIN/UPC/EAN/ISBN 结构与校验位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gtin-product-identity-masterdata/gtin-barcode-standard/gtin-upc-ean-isbn-structure","wordCount":2236,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"gtin-upc-ean-isbn-结构与校验位\">GTIN/UPC/EAN/ISBN 结构与校验位</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GTIN（Global Trade Item Number）不是一种条码，而是<strong>一套编号体系</strong>；EAN-13、UPC-A、ITF-14 是这套编号在特定符号体系里的载体。按照 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Trade_Item_Number\">GS1 对 GTIN 的定义</a>，它是「贸易项目的标识符」，由 <strong>厂商前缀（Company Prefix）+ 项目引用（Item Reference）+ 校验位（Check Digit）</strong> 三段组成，GTIN-14 还在最前面多一位<strong>指示符（Indicator Digit）</strong>，长度可为 8、12、13 或 14 位。同一件商品的这四种长度不是四个不同的编号，而是同一个数字在不同位宽下的表示——补零或去零就能互转。</p>\n<p>理解这一点的工程意义在于：系统内部<strong>应当只存一种规范形式</strong>，通常是 14 位补零形式（GTIN-14），在出口处（打印、上报、展示）再按目标场景裁剪。凡是允许多种位宽并存于同一列的设计，最终都会在去重、对账、渠道校验上付出代价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>位宽</th>\n<th>典型载体</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>前身名称</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GTIN-8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>EAN-8</td>\n<td>极小包装（口香糖、口红）</td>\n<td>EAN/UCC-8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GTIN-12</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>UPC-A、UPC-E</td>\n<td>北美零售单品</td>\n<td>UCC-12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GTIN-13</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>EAN-13、ITF-14、GS1-128</td>\n<td>全球零售单品、图书</td>\n<td>EAN、JAN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GTIN-14</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>ITF-14、GS1-128、GS1 DataBar</td>\n<td>批发与运输包装</td>\n<td>SCC-14、DUN-14</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  G14[GTIN-14 指示符+厂商前缀+项目引用+校验位] --&gt;|去掉首位指示符| G13[GTIN-13]&#10;  G13 --&gt;|左补零| G14&#10;  G13 --&gt;|去掉首位 0| G12[GTIN-12]&#10;  G12 --&gt;|左补零| G13&#10;  G13 --&gt;|前缀 978/979 重算校验位| ISBN13[ISBN-13]&#10;  ISBN13 --&gt;|前缀 978 时去前缀换校验位| ISBN10[ISBN-10]&#10;  G12 --&gt;|零压缩表示| UPCe[UPC-E]&#10;  UPCe --&gt;|扫码后还原| G12\">graph TD\n  G14[GTIN-14 指示符+厂商前缀+项目引用+校验位] --&gt;|去掉首位指示符| G13[GTIN-13]\n  G13 --&gt;|左补零| G14\n  G13 --&gt;|去掉首位 0| G12[GTIN-12]\n  G12 --&gt;|左补零| G13\n  G13 --&gt;|前缀 978/979 重算校验位| ISBN13[ISBN-13]\n  ISBN13 --&gt;|前缀 978 时去前缀换校验位| ISBN10[ISBN-10]\n  G12 --&gt;|零压缩表示| UPCe[UPC-E]\n  UPCe --&gt;|扫码后还原| G12</pre><h2 id=\"四段结构与位宽\">四段结构与位宽</h2><h3 id=\"指示符位的语义陷阱\">指示符位的语义陷阱</h3><p>GTIN-14 的首位是指示符，取值 1–8 被用来表示包装层级（内箱、外箱、托盘）、9 表示不定量商品（按重量计价的生鲜）。但 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Trade_Item_Number\">GS1 的资料明确指出</a>这一位<strong>没有全球统一的层级含义</strong>，「不应赋予该数字任何意义」，且<strong>取 0 不是合法值</strong>。这句话在工程上是硬约束：不要在代码里写 <code>if (indicator === 3) return PACKAGING_CASE</code>——你自己的层级约定是私有的，跨企业传输时必须通过 <code>packagingLevel</code> 这类显式属性表达，而不是靠这一位传递。</p>\n<h3 id=\"厂商前缀的可变长度\">厂商前缀的可变长度</h3><p>厂商前缀的长度不固定，由 GS1 成员组织根据企业申请的项目数量决定：申请量小的拿长前缀（项目引用空间小），申请量大的拿短前缀。因此<strong>同一个 GTIN-13 里，前缀的长度可能是 6、7、8、9 或更多位</strong>，解析时必须依赖随商品数据一起下发的 <code>companyPrefixLength</code> 或直接依赖「厂商已注册前缀表」做前缀匹配，而不能硬编码「前 7 位是厂商」。长度判断错误会导致两类故障：把别人的前缀认成自己的（误判占用），或把自己的项目引用切错（误判号段）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"upc-e-是表示法-不是编号体系\">UPC-E 是表示法，不是编号体系</h3><p>UPC-E 通过「零压缩」把 12 位的 UPC-A 压成 8 位的短码，但<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Trade_Item_Number\">扫描枪读出的始终是完整 12 位</a>。所以数据库里绝不该出现「UPC-E 编号」这一列——它是一个打印优化，不是一个标识。如果你的渠道对接文档里写着「上传 UPC-E 码」，正确做法是在出口时才做压缩转换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验位算法\">校验位算法</h2><h3 id=\"逐步推导\">逐步推导</h3><p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Check_digit\">GS1 校验位算法</a>的步骤是：① 排除最后一位校验位；② 对剩余各位交替加权 3 和 1；③ 加权求和后对 10 取模；④ 余数为 0 则校验位为 0，否则校验位为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>余数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 - \\text{余数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">余数</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>难点在<strong>权重的起始端</strong>，这是实现中最常见的错误。两种等价表述：对于 UPC-A/GTIN-12，从左起奇数位（第 1、3、5…位）乘 3；对于 EAN-13/GTIN-13/ISBN-13，从左起奇数位乘 1、偶数位乘 3。另一种更不易错的表述是「<strong>从校验位左边一位开始，向左交替乘 3、1、3、1…</strong>」——这个表述对所有位宽都成立，建议直接照它实现。</p>\n<p>以 <code>978-0747532699</code> 为例：奇数位求和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9+8+7+7+3+6=40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span>，偶数位求和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7+0+4+5+2+9=27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span></span></span>，加权后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>121</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40 + 27\\times3 = 121</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">121</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>121</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">121 \\bmod 10 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">121</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，校验位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 10-1 = 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span>，与给出的 <code>...699</code> 末位一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- GTIN 定长存储 + 校验位生成/校验（PostgreSQL）&#10;CREATE TABLE product_identity_gtin (&#10;  gtin14          CHAR(14) PRIMARY KEY CHECK (gtin14 ~ &#39;^[0-9]{14}$&#39; AND left(gtin14,1) &lt;&gt; &#39;0&#39;),&#10;  indicator       CHAR(1)  NOT NULL CHECK (indicator BETWEEN &#39;1&#39; AND &#39;9&#39;),&#10;  company_prefix  VARCHAR(12) NOT NULL,&#10;  prefix_len      SMALLINT NOT NULL CHECK (prefix_len BETWEEN 6 AND 12),&#10;  item_ref        VARCHAR(8)  NOT NULL,&#10;  brand_owner_gln CHAR(13)    NOT NULL,&#10;  allocated_at    DATE        NOT NULL,&#10;  retired_at      DATE,&#10;  CONSTRAINT ref_len_ok CHECK (length(company_prefix) = prefix_len&#10;                           AND length(item_ref) = 13 - prefix_len)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 通用校验位计算：从校验位左边一位起向左交替乘 3、1&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION gs1_check_digit(body text) RETURNS char LANGUAGE sql IMMUTABLE AS $$&#10;  SELECT ((10 - (sum(d * CASE WHEN i % 2 = 1 THEN 3 ELSE 1 END) % 10)) % 10)::text::char&#10;  FROM (SELECT (substring(reverse(body) from i for 1))::int AS d, i&#10;        FROM generate_series(1, length(body)) AS i) t;&#10;$$;&#10;&#10;-- 校验：完整 GTIN 的校验位必须等于去掉末位的计算结果&#10;SELECT gtin14, gs1_check_digit(left(gtin14,13)) = right(gtin14,1) AS valid&#10;FROM product_identity_gtin WHERE retired_at IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- GTIN 定长存储 + 校验位生成/校验（PostgreSQL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> product_identity_gtin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gtin14          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (gtin14 ~ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^[0-9]{14}$'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gtin14,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shik